s://www.discogs.com/artist/3803005-NATURE-DANGER-GANG","type":"artist","urls":["https://twitter.com/WeAreNDG","http://nature-danger-gang.tumblr.com/"]}},"/api/discogs/artist/5061709/profile":{"cached":true,"profile":{"id":"5061709","image":"https://i.discogs.com/1EsXtSdLL1sLjq9f9oOkjnoDq9GCNcwuoc7i68VJvuo/rs:fit/g:sm/q:90/h:600/w:600/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9BLTUwNjE3/MDktMTU1MjA0Nzc3/MS03ODE5LmpwZWc.jpeg","imageThumb":"https://i.discogs.com/FDqeshkKMuCuwrB__W5btD9-uuA_c3zwTaFJK6miOc8/rs:fit/g:sm/q:40/h:150/w:150/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9BLTUwNjE3/MDktMTU1MjA0Nzc3/MS03ODE5LmpwZWc.jpeg","profile":"","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:artist:5061709","relations":{"aliases":null,"groups":null,"members":[{"active":true,"id":5061708,"name":"Carolyn Schofield"}],"namevariations":null},"schemaVersion":2,"sourceUrl":"https://www.discogs.com/artist/5061709-Fia-Fiell","type":"artist","urls":[]}},"/api/discogs/artist/645346/profile":{"cached":true,"profile":{"id":"645346","image":"","imageThumb":"","profile":"","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:artist:645346","relations":{"aliases":[{"id":227234,"name":"Flow Dan"}],"groups":null,"members":null,"namevariations":null},"schemaVersion":2,"sourceUrl":"https://www.discogs.com/artist/645346-Flowdan","type":"artist","urls":[]}},"/api/discogs/artist/80121/profile":{"cached":true,"profile":{"id":"80121","image":"https://i.discogs.com/nnQF_vSayFCqAQ0PmOaz3gwZ1EfazlnB9vv5owuJEzA/rs:fit/g:sm/q:90/h:571/w:600/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9BLTgwMTIx/LTEzOTU1ODM5Mzkt/OTYwMy5qcGVn.jpeg","imageThumb":"https://i.discogs.com/VY7XTZggCNiqP_yDOeNzqvwKdy4kqbxOlciy_dAJtfY/rs:fit/g:sm/q:40/h:150/w:150/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9BLTgwMTIx/LTEzOTU1ODM5Mzkt/OTYwMy5qcGVn.jpeg","profile":"Soul - funk disco band\r\nFormed in 1959 as [url=http://www.discogs.com/artist/3382145-Linda-The-Del-Rios]The Del-Rios[/url] as backing vocal group for [a=Linda Steele (2)]. After disbanding they renamed [a=Chubby And The Turnpikes]. Four Cape Verdean - American brothers, born and raised in Providence, Rhode Island, they would later move to New Bedford, Massachusetts. They were signed to [l=Capitol Records] in 1967 and released three singles. In the 1970s, they renamed the group Tavares and had a No.1 R'n'B hit with their cover of [a=Daryl Hall & John Oates]' [url=http://www.discogs.com/Tavares-Shes-Gone/release/4164892]\"She's Gone\"[/url] in 1974. Their biggest hits are 1975's [url=http://www.discogs.com/Tavares-It-Only-Takes-A-Minute/release/888864]\"It Only Takes A Minute\" [/url], covered in 1992 by [a=Take That] and [url=http://www.discogs.com/Tavares-Heaven-Must-Be-Missing-An-Angel/release/2673323]\"Heaven Must Be Missing An Angel\"[/url]. They have duetted with [a=Freda Payne] for [url=http://www.discogs.com/Tavares-With-Freda-Payne-I-Wanna-See-You-Again/release/2185335]\"I Wanna See You Soon\"[/url] in 1977. Tavares appeared on the soundtrack of [url=http://www.discogs.com/Various-Saturday-Night-Fever-The-Original-Movie-Sound-Track/release/451426]\"Saturday Night Fever\"[/url] and won a Grammy award for their rendition of [a=Bee Gees]' [url=http://www.discogs.com/Tavares-More-Than-A-Woman-Keep-In-Touch/release/1714643]\"More Than A Woman\"[/url] in 1978. After ten albums for [l=Capitol Records] (produced by [a=Johnny Bristol], the duo [a=Brian Potter] and [a=Dennis Lambert], [a=Freddie Perren], [a=Bobby Martin], [a=Benjamin Wright] and [a=Bobby Colomby], [a=Alan Abrahams (2)]), they signed to [l=RCA Victor] in 1980 for two albums (produced by [a=Jay Senter], [a=Kenny Nolan], [a=Richard Wyatt Jr.], [a=Leon Sylvers], [a=Wardell Potts] and [a=Dana Meyers]). [a=Ralph Tavares] left the group in 1984 and [a=Tiny Tavares] left in the mid '90s but reunited with the group in 2009 for live concerts.","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:artist:80121","relations":{"aliases":[{"id":2326016,"name":"Chubby And The Turnpikes"}],"groups":null,"members":[{"active":true,"id":379024,"